---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

export function getStaticPaths() {
  return [
    {
      params: { slug: "yannick-ngakoue-ravens-2020" },
    },
  ];
}
---

<BaseLayout title="Yannick Ngakoue to Ravens | TradeVerdicts">
  <main>
    <section class="trade-hero">
      <div class="eyebrow">NFL Trade Verdict</div>
      <h1>Yannick Ngakoue to Baltimore Ravens</h1>
      <p>
        A short-lived Minnesota gamble ended with the Vikings moving Ngakoue to
        Baltimore for draft capital before the 2020 trade deadline.
      </p>

      <div class="badges">
        <span>October 22, 2020</span>
        <span>MIN ↔ BAL</span>
        <span>Verdict: Ravens Win</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="scoreboard">
      <div class="team-panel">
        <h2>Baltimore Ravens</h2>
        <div class="grade">A</div>
        <p>Added pass-rush help for a playoff push at a reasonable cost.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="team-panel">
        <h2>Minnesota Vikings</h2>
        <div class="grade bad">D</div>
        <p>Recovered draft capital, but the original acquisition quickly unraveled.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="analysis">
      <h2>Trade Summary</h2>
      <p>
        The Vikings acquired Yannick Ngakoue before the 2020 season, hoping to
        create a dangerous pass-rushing duo. Instead, Minnesota’s season slipped
        quickly, Danielle Hunter remained unavailable, and Ngakoue became a
        short-term asset rather than a long-term building block.
      </p>

      <p>
        Baltimore benefited by adding a proven edge rusher without making a
        franchise-altering commitment. Minnesota avoided losing him for nothing,
        but the sequence still reflected a failed win-now swing.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .trade-hero {
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 5vw, 4.2rem);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .trade-hero p,
  .analysis p,
  .team-panel p {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .trade-hero p {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }

  .badges {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .badges span {
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .scoreboard {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .team-panel,
  .analysis {
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 24px;
  }

  .team-panel h2,
  .analysis h2 {
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .grade {
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--good);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .grade.bad {
    color: var(--bad);
  }

  .analysis p + p {
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .scoreboard {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>